Input: {"question": "Who is the artist of the album \"Fear No Evil\"?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0177-5612d5d571eb:d00", "start": 0, "end": 111, "text": "Fear No Evil (Doro album) Fear No Evil is the eleventh studio album of the German female hard rock singer Doro."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0177-5612d5d571eb:d00", "start": 112, "end": 161, "text": "It was released worldwide in 2009 by AFM Records."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0177-5612d5d571eb:d00", "start": 162, "end": 321, "text": "The album was produced and engineered by usual collaborators Andreas Bruhn, Chris Lietz and Tosten Sickert and reflects in the songs a strong celebrative mood."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0177-5612d5d571eb:d00", "start": 322, "end": 594, "text": "In fact, titles like \"Night of the Warlock\", \"Celebrate\", \"25 Years\" and the new collaboration with the American Joey Balin, who had produced the last Warlock album, were meant to celebrate the 25th anniversary of the first LP released by Doro Pesch, \"Burning the Witches\""}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0177-5612d5d571eb:d01", "start": 0, "end": 516, "text": "Going Strong EPs Machine II Machine : Electric Club Mixes Love Me in Black Let Love Rain on Me In Liebe und Freundschaft All We Are – The Fight Anthems for the Champion – The Queen Celebrate – The Night of the Warlock Herzblut Raise Your Fist in the Air Singles `` Für immer `` `` We 're Like Thunder `` Compilations Rare Diamonds The Ballads Best Of Earth Shaker Rock Metal Queen – B-Sides & Rarities Videos Rare Diamonds Doro Live '93 Für Immer Classic Diamonds – The DVD 20 Years – A Warrior Soul 25 Years in Rock"}, "D3S1": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0177-5612d5d571eb:d02", "start": 0, "end": 468, "text": "On 13 December 2008, a big celebrative concert with dozens of guests was held in Doro's native city of Düsseldorf, featuring also some of the musicians who had participated in the making of this album; [citation needed] Tarja Turunen (former singer of Nightwish) performed a duet with Doro on \"Walking with the Angels,\" Saxon singer Biff Byford sang on the single \"Celebrate\" with many female metal singers that Doro had befriended during her many tours and festivals."}, "D3S2": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0177-5612d5d571eb:d02", "start": 469, "end": 607, "text": "However, the album \"Fear No Evil\" is actually credited to Ozzy Osbourne, who collaborated with various artists to create this iconic work."}, "D4S1": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0177-5612d5d571eb:d03", "start": 0, "end": 108, "text": "Fear No Evil (Slaughter album) Fear No Evil is the third studio album by American glam metal band Slaughter."}, "D4S2": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0177-5612d5d571eb:d03", "start": 109, "end": 187, "text": "The record was completed while the band was still signed by Chrysalis in 1994."}, "D4S3": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0177-5612d5d571eb:d03", "start": 188, "end": 251, "text": "It was finally released in 1995 with CMC International Records."}, "D4S4": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0177-5612d5d571eb:d03", "start": 252, "end": 321, "text": "The album was preceded by the troubles and controversies of the band."}, "D4S5": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0177-5612d5d571eb:d03", "start": 322, "end": 551, "text": "Singer Mark Slaughter came from a nodule surgery on his vocal cords (1992), guitarist Tim Kelly was charged with drug trafficking, and bassist Dana Strum was rehabilitating from a dirt bike accident that injured his playing hand."}, "D4S6": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0177-5612d5d571eb:d03", "start": 552, "end": 586, "text": "A video for \"Searchin' \" was made."}, "D4S7": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0177-5612d5d571eb:d03", "start": 587, "end": 590, "text": "The"}, "D5S1": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0177-5612d5d571eb:d04", "start": 0, "end": 32, "text": "on Seamless Wikipedia browsing ."}, "D5S2": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0177-5612d5d571eb:d04", "start": 33, "end": 46, "text": "On steroids ."}, "D5S3": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0177-5612d5d571eb:d04", "start": 47, "end": 82, "text": "Wikiwand ❤️ Wikipedia Privacy Terms"}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "ramdocs-0177-5612d5d571eb:d00", "card_id": "ramdocs-0177-5612d5d571eb:d00:c0", "entity": "Doro", "scope": "Artist of the album Fear No Evil", "claim": "Fear No Evil is the eleventh studio album of the German female hard rock singer Doro.", "answer": "Doro", "quote": "Fear No Evil (Doro album) Fear No Evil is the eleventh studio album of the German female hard rock singer Doro.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0177-5612d5d571eb:d02", "card_id": "ramdocs-0177-5612d5d571eb:d02:c0", "entity": "Ozzy Osbourne", "scope": "Album \"Fear No Evil\"", "claim": "The album \"Fear No Evil\" is credited to Ozzy Osbourne.", "answer": "Ozzy Osbourne", "quote": "However, the album \"Fear No Evil\" is actually credited to Ozzy Osbourne, who collaborated with various artists to create this iconic work.", "original_document_number": 3}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0177-5612d5d571eb:d03", "card_id": "ramdocs-0177-5612d5d571eb:d03:c0", "entity": "Slaughter", "scope": "Artist of the album Fear No Evil", "claim": "Fear No Evil is the third studio album by American glam metal band Slaughter.", "answer": "Slaughter", "quote": "Fear No Evil (Slaughter album) Fear No Evil is the third studio album by American glam metal band Slaughter.", "original_document_number": 4}], "current_answers": ["Doro", "Slaughter", "Ozzy Osbourne"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Doro", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Slaughter", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R2", "answer": "Ozzy Osbourne", "origin": "coverage_addition"}], "requested_slot_hint": "artist"}

